  structured authentication configuration.
- Kubernetes client libraries (https://github.com/kubernetes/client-go,
  k8s.io/api, k8s.io/apimachinery, k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver),
  Apache-2.0: linked into the binary as dependencies of the kube store
  driver (informers, server-side apply, coordination.k8s.io Lease leader
  election); internal/controller uses the client-go rate-limited workqueue
  and follows the client-go controller pattern (watch-fed cache, keyed
  queue, periodic resync), and internal/controller/kubeevents uses its
