- controller-runtime (https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime),
  Apache-2.0: linked into the binary for the client and informer cache of
  the kube store driver; its envtest package runs a control plane in the
  driver's tests only. The Watch catch-up barrier is informed by its
  read-your-writes consistency client, and the envtest binary layout
  (bin/k8s/<version>-<os>-<arch>) follows its setup-envtest tool.
- modernc.org/sqlite (https://gitlab.com/cznic/sqlite), BSD-3-Clause: linked
